flowchart LR
  subgraph Source["mohan-dotfiles — the ONLY place you edit"]
    Nix["nix/*.nix — one module per tool"]
    Agents["agents/ — AGENTS.md, skills/, boilerplats/, style/"]
    Hooks["claude/hooks, copilot/hooks, pi/agent/extensions"]
    Mem[".ai-memory/ — manifest.json plus these diagrams"]
  end

  Source -->|"1. ./setup.sh"| HM["home-manager switch --impure, pinned by flake.lock"]
  HM -->|"2. builds and links, result is READ-ONLY"| Home["$HOME — ~/.claude, ~/.agents, ~/.config"]

  Home --> Claude["Claude Code — claude/settings.json"]
  Home --> Copilot["Copilot CLI — copilot/mohan-hooks.json"]
  Home --> Pi["pi — agent/extensions/hooks"]

  Agents -.->|"one shared payload, all three harnesses"| Claude
  Agents -.-> Copilot
  Agents -.-> Pi

  Claude -->|"3. every prompt and every tool call is gated"| Gauntlet["flows/prompt-lifecycle.mmd plus flows/tool-guard-path.mmd"]
  Gauntlet -.->|"4. blocked boilerplate is redirected into"| Scaffold["agents/boilerplats — flows/scaffold-a-file.mmd"]
  Mem -->|"5. one matched diagram injected per prompt"| Claude

  Note["Editing the copy under $HOME is always wrong — the next apply reverts it and leaves NAME.hm-backup beside it"]
  Home -.-> Note
